Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value AUTO (\S+)
Value STATUS (up|down|\S+)
Value VLAN ([\d,-]+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^port-name\s+speed\s+duplex\s+auto\s+state\s+VLAN\s+description
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${AUTO}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${AUTO}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
